    "created_at": "2026-09-27T06:29:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-27T06:29:17Z",
    "body": "Hell yeah please make this a thing. I love using Firefox (originally for \"engine diversity\" reasons) but this 12 hr time selector is just killing me.\n\nThere is a reason why almost every OS allows setting 24 vs 12 on top of the otherwise mostly invariant locale setting. 24 is really useful, a lot of the time!\n\n> Intl.DateTimeFormat options \n\nI believe skissane's proposal is basically that, being an extension of `hourCycle`.",
